{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Information.HeckeLogDecomposition","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Information.HeckeLogDecomposition","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.QSubstrate","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Log.Basic"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.hecke_log_decomposition_at_q0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.hecke_log_decomposition_at_q0","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/HeckeLogDecomposition.lean#L63-L69","doc":"Numerical equality at the QOU substrate parameter q_0:\nlog(1/h(q_0)) = log(1/ℏ_q(q_0)) - log(1 + q_0) ≈ 1.56513...\nVerified to 50 dps in probe_delta_coupling_q_edgeworth.py. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.hecke_log_decomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.hecke_log_decomposition","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/HeckeLogDecomposition.lean#L36-L61","doc":"log(1/h) = log(1/ℏ_q) - log(1 + q) at every q > 1\n(so h > 0 and the log is well-defined). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.hecke_skein_factorization","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.hecke_skein_factorization","kind":"theorem","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/HeckeLogDecomposition.lean#L28-L34","doc":"The Hecke deformation h := q - q⁻¹ factors as ℏ_q · (q + 1) where\nℏ_q = (q - 1)/q is the QOU quantum Planck constant. ","signatureChunk":0}]}